{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1367.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"e8e113afd149cd8e05ba5dca932f42be0168a89aacbf580ff5bb90803fdd5773","ja":"亜利沙の決意！","zh":"亚利沙的决心！","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1367.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"bbaa77426ded10934d6788d66a7a0bbcbcd8e9dc521b37421d0a5e3e37be5b6d","ja":"ありさはやっぱり、アイドルちゃんたちに頼まれたら、\nシトリム王子をお見せすることにします！","zh":"亚利沙果然还是决定，要是被偶像们拜托的话，\n就把席特林王子展示给她们看！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1367.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"3706bd57b5bb6a17c504e343406fbb630396c5afaaa194d0c57100e2bd1abab9","ja":"それはいいことだと思うけど……\n急にどうしたの？","zh":"这虽然是好事……\n但怎么突然提这个？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1367.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"0df8f1cd108dc274337a4d8dfe070e227590911339b87327c87c47e58223f92f","ja":"さっきのお話を聞いていて、\nありさの中に葛藤が生まれたんです。","zh":"刚才听了那番话后，\n亚利沙的心中产生了纠结。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1367.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"a539fbe63c0d8666fc2d5d00ba8b3e6d1baeb1d4eae7aca764a4f11bbd3c7589","ja":"かわいい真くんも見たいですが、\nやっぱりいつもの真くんも見ていたいって！","zh":"虽说也想看到可爱的真，\n但果然还是想一直看着平时的真呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1367.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"73b4973804ef57a5eec2a87602ef26597ed43919851dc05bb2297f480ba4e12b","ja":"そう思ったら、ありさもアイドルちゃんの期待に\nお応えするべきなんじゃないかって！","zh":"这么一想，亚利沙也应该回应\n偶像小可爱的期待才是！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1367.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"e62175c37e7bbd954c069c443c8d6c702fc0654ca60401fdd21767ad507945fe","ja":"あはは……そんなことを思ってくれてたんだね。\nでも、恥ずかしいのは大丈夫なの？","zh":"啊哈哈……原来你是这么想的啊。\n不过，害羞这一点没关系吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1367.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"7e8a85746f923823e5c23f540cfd72ca6e4c2499ff85428a1fda2f880008c192","ja":"うっ……大丈夫ではないです。でも……。","zh":"呜……并不是没事。但是……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1367.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"c32bf426c2366c469433267f05aa1a1762ae35a4a30bf7f81c4b2879568ec2db","ja":"アイドルちゃんたちのためなら、\n耐えてみせます！","zh":"为了可爱的偶像们，\n我一定会撑下去的！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1367.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"a265f2c21a1dd3c78a4098a385f9037f018106befc4555ed325151e34b93fbad","ja":"ふ～ん、真のおかげで、亜利沙もみんなの王子様に\n目覚めたってことね。解決してよかったじゃない。","zh":"哼～，也就是说多亏了真，亚利沙也觉醒成\n大家的王子殿下了呢。能解决不是挺好的嘛。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1367.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"52e79412a5569d2450b5c10605a5ddece050049fe7c2ed18677f1926c83d8fa6","ja":"うん、そうだね！\nそれは本当によかったんだけど……。","zh":"嗯，是啊！\n那确实太好了，可是……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1367.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"ffc60353e0c9dcb1a7bd66c38b19b0bf22f725f87321cbb46adc08b6997fe42b","ja":"でもやっぱり、亜利沙とフリフリの服を着て、\nキャピキャピな感じになりたかったなぁ……くぅ！","zh":"不过果然还是想和亚利沙一起穿荷叶边衣服，\n体验一把元气可爱的少女感啊……呜～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
